# Who is the host? (edit every line; this is what makes classification accurate)

Host: <your name / company name>
What we sell: <one or two sentences: the offer prospects buy>
Who our clients are: <who pays us and what we deliver to them>

## Team (people who are NEVER the client or prospect)
- <Name>: <role>
- <Name>: <role>

## Call naming (optional; titles are weak evidence, the conversation always wins)
- "<Title pattern>" usually means <sales / fulfillment / internal>

## Recurring group calls (file as group, not client)
- <e.g. Weekly office hours, Monday huddle, bootcamp sessions>
